window.COMIC_I18N = {"en":{"eyebrow":"Life, frame by frame · A personal memoir","intro":"From a coastal village in Ningbo to Paris, teaching, and building with AI. The moments that shaped me, told in sixteen illustrated chapters.","description":"A personal story in sixteen illustrated chapters: growing up on the coast, finding confidence, learning languages, teaching, Paris and building with AI.","skip":"Skip to the comic","navLabel":"Main navigation","myStory":"← My story","languagesLabel":"Language","choosePage":"Choose a comic page","previous":"Previous page","next":"Next page","previousLink":"← Previous page","nextLink":"Next page →","chaptersLabel":"Story chapters","continues":"The story continues","backStory":"Back to my story ↗","textVersion":"Read the text version ↗","wordsEyebrow":"The story in words","wordsTitle":"The story in words","illustratedVersion":"Read the illustrated version ↗","backIllustrated":"← Read the illustrated version","seeFrames":"See this chapter in frames ↗","noScript":"Page navigation needs JavaScript.","noScriptLink":"Read the complete text version.","resume":"Continue from page {page} →","pageStatus":"Page {page} of {total}: {title}.","loadError":"The illustration could not load. The story text is still available below each frame.","darkTheme":"Switch to dark theme","lightTheme":"Switch to light theme","entryLabel":"Life in frames","entryLead":"I wanted to see","entryAccent":"the world.","entryIntro":"A coastal village, the long road to confidence, and the languages that opened my world. Sixteen illustrated chapters, from childhood to what I am building today.","entryCount":"16 chapters","entryCoverRead":"Read my story","entryReadAria":"Read I Wanted to See the World","entryCoverAlt":"A cargo truck leaving a coastal village in Ningbo","entryReadAtPace":"Read in your language · At your own pace.","range":"Pages {start}–{end} ↗","bookTitle":"I Wanted to See the World","chapter.0":"From the Coast","range.0":"Pages 01–03 ↗","chapter.1":"Finding My Way","range.1":"Pages 04–08 ↗","chapter.2":"Turning a Corner","range.2":"Pages 09–11 ↗","chapter.3":"A Wider World","range.3":"Pages 12–16 ↗","page.1.title":"The First Journeys","page.1.option":"01 · The First Journeys","page.1.eyebrow":"01 / From the Coast","page.1.caption.0":"I grew up in a coastal village in Xianxiang, Ningbo.","page.1.caption.1":"As a child, I often stayed in my dad's truck and travelled with him on deliveries.","page.1.caption.2":"That was my first glimpse of the world beyond home.","page.1.alt.0":"A cargo truck on a road through a coastal village in Ningbo.","page.1.alt.1":"A boy riding beside his father in the cab of a truck.","page.1.alt.2":"The boy looking out of the truck window at the road beyond.","page.2.title":"A World Beyond Home","page.2.option":"02 · A World Beyond Home","page.2.eyebrow":"02 / From the Coast","page.2.caption.0":"Visits to relatives at Chinese New Year were my chance to see city life.","page.2.caption.1":"My sister would take me out to play. Those are some of my warmest childhood memories.","page.2.caption.2":"I came to believe that studying hard was my way out.","page.2.caption.3":"A good university could open up more possibilities.","page.2.alt.0":"A family visiting relatives during Chinese New Year.","page.2.alt.1":"An older sister playing with her younger brother.","page.2.alt.2":"The boy studying at a desk at home.","page.2.alt.3":"The boy looking up from a book toward the window.","page.3.title":"Running, Jumping, Playing","page.3.option":"03 · Running, Jumping, Playing","page.3.eyebrow":"03 / From the Coast","page.3.caption.0":"In fourth grade, I represented Xianxiang and won the Yinzhou district high jump competition.","page.3.caption.1":"I also came fourth in the 800 metres.","page.3.caption.2":"I kept training. In junior high, I often won the school's 400- and 800-metre races.","page.3.caption.3":"I started basketball in third grade. By sixth grade, I could do a between-the-legs layup.","page.3.alt.0":"A schoolboy clearing the bar in a high jump competition.","page.3.alt.1":"The boy running an 800-metre race.","page.3.alt.2":"A junior-high student crossing the finish line.","page.3.alt.3":"A boy performing a basketball layup.","page.4.title":"The Door I Almost Reached","page.4.option":"04 · The Door I Almost Reached","page.4.eyebrow":"04 / Finding My Way","page.4.caption.0":"My grades were uneven in my first two years of junior high.","page.4.caption.1":"In my final year, I caught up.","page.4.caption.2":"I qualified for a top provincial high school's special admissions exam.","page.4.caption.3":"But I fell short of the minimum score.","page.4.alt.0":"A junior-high student facing several school subjects.","page.4.alt.1":"The student revising with growing concentration.","page.4.alt.2":"The student looking hopeful about an admissions opportunity.","page.4.alt.3":"The student looking quietly disappointed by exam results.","page.5.title":"Back to the Desk","page.5.option":"05 · Back to the Desk","page.5.eyebrow":"05 / Finding My Way","page.5.caption.0":"That setback hit me hard. Its shadow stayed with me for years.","page.5.caption.1":"Under enormous pressure, I returned to preparing for the regular high school entrance exam.","page.5.caption.2":"In the end, I finished first in my class.","page.5.caption.3":"I entered Zhengshi High School in Ningbo, still some way from what I had hoped for.","page.5.alt.0":"A student sitting alone after a disappointing exam.","page.5.alt.1":"The student returning to his entrance-exam revision.","page.5.alt.2":"The student holding his class results.","page.5.alt.3":"The student entering a high-school campus in Ningbo.","page.6.title":"Under Other People's Gaze","page.6.option":"06 · Under Other People's Gaze","page.6.eyebrow":"06 / Finding My Way","page.6.caption.0":"As I grew through high school, my underbite became severe.","page.6.caption.1":"I was given hurtful nicknames and mocked.","page.6.caption.2":"I became painfully aware of how others saw me. My confidence faded.","page.6.caption.3":"Being around people gradually became stressful.","page.6.alt.0":"A high-school student seeing his pronounced underbite in the mirror.","page.6.alt.1":"The student feeling self-conscious in a school corridor.","page.6.alt.2":"The student standing apart from a group.","page.6.alt.3":"The student walking alone toward his dormitory.","page.7.title":"A Light in the Night","page.7.option":"07 · A Light in the Night","page.7.eyebrow":"07 / Finding My Way","page.7.caption.0":"Some nights, I hid in the dormitory bathroom and cried.","page.7.caption.2":"I woke early, stayed up late, and poured much of my time into studying.","page.7.caption.3":"In my last two years of high school, I often ranked first in my year. English had always come naturally to me.","page.7.alt.0":"A quiet dormitory corridor and a student at the bathroom doorway.","page.7.alt.1":"The student wiping away tears, with his pre-surgery jaw visible.","page.7.alt.2":"The student studying under a warm desk lamp at night.","page.7.alt.3":"The student concentrating on an English book.","page.8.title":"Learning and Teaching","page.8.option":"08 · Learning and Teaching","page.8.eyebrow":"08 / Finding My Way","page.8.caption.0":"My university entrance exam did not go as well as I had hoped.","page.8.caption.1":"I chose Zhejiang Gongshang University over a Project 211 university outside Zhejiang.","page.8.caption.2":"I began teaching English after high school. I have kept teaching ever since.","page.8.caption.3":"I loved languages and trusted my ability to learn them, so I chose to major in French.","page.8.caption.4":"University gave me more freedom, but the distress over my jaw remained.","page.8.alt.0":"A high-school graduate considering his university exam results.","page.8.alt.1":"The graduate weighing his university choices.","page.8.alt.2":"The young man beginning to teach English.","page.8.alt.3":"An undergraduate opening a French coursebook.","page.8.alt.4":"The undergraduate walking across campus before jaw surgery.","page.9.title":"My Family Beside Me","page.9.option":"09 · My Family Beside Me","page.9.eyebrow":"09 / Turning a Corner","page.9.caption.0":"My family took me to Shanghai Ninth People's Hospital for a consultation.","page.9.caption.1":"I decided to have corrective jaw surgery.","page.9.caption.2":"Before surgery, I needed orthodontic treatment.","page.9.caption.3":"It lasted more than two years, much longer than I had expected.","page.9.alt.0":"A young man and his family in a hospital waiting area.","page.9.alt.1":"The family listening to a doctor during a consultation.","page.9.alt.2":"An orthodontic appointment before jaw surgery.","page.9.alt.3":"Calendar pages suggesting the long wait during treatment.","page.10.title":"After the Long Wait","page.10.option":"10 · After the Long Wait","page.10.eyebrow":"10 / Turning a Corner","page.10.caption.0":"During treatment, my underbite became more pronounced, and the emotional strain grew.","page.10.caption.1":"I withdrew from social life and focused on studying. I consistently ranked first in my major, academically and overall.","page.10.caption.2":"In the second semester of my junior year, I finally had surgery.","page.10.alt.0":"An undergraduate sitting alone during orthodontic treatment.","page.10.alt.1":"The undergraduate studying, his pre-surgery jaw clearly visible.","page.10.alt.2":"The young man with a family member before surgery.","page.10.alt.3":"The young man resting by a hospital window after surgery.","page.11.title":"A Brighter Chapter","page.11.option":"11 · A Brighter Chapter","page.11.eyebrow":"11 / Turning a Corner","page.11.caption.0":"Surgery changed my appearance. I began to regain the confidence to face everyday life.","page.11.caption.1":"Two months later, I secured recommended admission to the School of International Business at Southwestern University of Finance and Economics.","page.11.caption.2":"I also received the National Scholarship. After so much pressure and waiting, it was a bright moment in my life.","page.11.alt.0":"A university student walking on campus after jaw surgery.","page.11.alt.1":"The student receiving news of postgraduate admission.","page.11.alt.2":"The student standing in warm campus light with a folder.","page.12.title":"Into the Working World","page.12.option":"12 · Into the Working World","page.12.eyebrow":"12 / A Wider World","page.12.caption.0":"After securing my postgraduate place, I interned at Mingle Advisors, a Finnish firm in Hangzhou.","page.12.caption.1":"After graduation, I worked in French-speaking overseas sales at Market Union in Ningbo, helping close nearly US$1 million in orders.","page.12.caption.2":"Then I moved to Chengdu for graduate school.","page.12.caption.3":"Chengdu was a happy chapter. I studied, interned at Alliance Française, and continued teaching English.","page.12.alt.0":"An internship in a small company office in Hangzhou.","page.12.alt.1":"Working in overseas sales in Ningbo.","page.12.alt.2":"Arriving in Chengdu for graduate study.","page.12.alt.3":"Studying and preparing language lessons in Chengdu.","page.13.title":"Choosing to Go","page.13.option":"13 · Choosing to Go","page.13.eyebrow":"13 / A Wider World","page.13.caption.0":"Then came another choice: should I study abroad?","page.13.caption.1":"Going would mean delaying graduation.","page.13.caption.2":"I thought about it for a long time. Since childhood, I had wanted to see the world.","page.13.caption.3":"I chose a one-year exchange at Paris 1 Panthéon-Sorbonne University.","page.13.alt.0":"Reading about an overseas exchange programme.","page.13.alt.1":"Weighing the exchange against a later graduation.","page.13.alt.2":"A window scene echoing the childhood truck journeys.","page.13.alt.3":"Preparing exchange application papers and a travel bag.","page.14.title":"A New Direction","page.14.option":"14 · A New Direction","page.14.eyebrow":"14 / A Wider World","page.14.caption.0":"Before leaving, I spent four months in overseas talent recruitment at ByteDance in Chengdu.","page.14.caption.1":"I helped ByteDance's Seed AI team recruit top talent in North America.","page.14.caption.2":"That experience drew me into AI and pushed me to learn more.","page.14.caption.3":"With a new direction taking shape, I left for Paris.","page.14.alt.0":"An overseas recruitment internship in Chengdu.","page.14.alt.1":"Supporting a remote talent recruitment conversation.","page.14.alt.2":"Learning about AI through books and notes.","page.14.alt.3":"Looking out of an airplane window on the way to Paris.","page.15.title":"The Limits of My World","page.15.option":"15 · The Limits of My World","page.15.eyebrow":"15 / A Wider World","page.15.caption.0":"During my year in Paris, I also spent a year learning Spanish.","page.15.caption.1":"I have always loved languages. I explored Paris, France, and other parts of Europe.","page.15.caption.2":"The limits of my language are the limits of my world.","page.15.alt.0":"An exchange student taking notes in a Spanish-language class in Paris.","page.15.alt.1":"The student exploring a European street with a day bag.","page.15.alt.2":"The student walking along a sunlit Paris street.","page.15.closing":"The child who wanted to see the world had finally made it.","page.16.title":"Still Exploring","page.16.option":"16 · Still Exploring","page.16.eyebrow":"16 / A Wider World","page.16.caption.0":"After returning from Paris, I joined Tencent Cloud as a direct sales intern.","page.16.caption.1":"My experience with AI helped me find my direction. I keep building with AI and learning more about cloud computing.","page.16.caption.2":"I have taught English since leaving high school. Years of experience have only deepened my enthusiasm for teaching.","page.16.caption.3":"Languages opened up my world. And there is still so much I want to explore.","page.16.alt.0":"Starting work in cloud sales.","page.16.alt.1":"Building and learning with AI on a laptop.","page.16.alt.2":"Teaching English with confidence and enthusiasm.","page.16.alt.3":"Looking through a window, with books and a laptop nearby."},"zh":{"eyebrow":"一格一格，画下成长 · 我的故事","intro":"从宁波的沿海村庄，到巴黎、教书和用AI构建。用十六个图画章节，讲述那些塑造我的片刻。","description":"十六个图画章节里的成长故事：海边童年、找回自信、学习语言、教书、巴黎与用AI构建。","skip":"跳到漫画","navLabel":"主导航","myStory":"← 我的故事","languagesLabel":"语言","choosePage":"选择漫画页码","previous":"上一页","next":"下一页","previousLink":"← 上一页","nextLink":"下一页 →","chaptersLabel":"故事章节","continues":"故事还在继续","backStory":"返回我的故事 ↗","textVersion":"阅读文字版 ↗","wordsEyebrow":"文字里的故事","wordsTitle":"文字里的故事","illustratedVersion":"阅读漫画版 ↗","backIllustrated":"← 阅读漫画版","seeFrames":"查看本章漫画 ↗","noScript":"漫画翻页需要启用JavaScript。","noScriptLink":"阅读完整文字版。","resume":"从第{page}页继续阅读 →","pageStatus":"第{page}页，共{total}页：{title}。","loadError":"插画未能加载，你仍可以阅读各画格下方的文字。","darkTheme":"切换深色主题","lightTheme":"切换浅色主题","entryLabel":"成长漫画","entryLead":"我想去看看","entryAccent":"更大的世界。","entryIntro":"从沿海村庄出发，走过找回自信的漫长旅程，用语言打开世界。十六个图画章节，讲述从童年到今天的成长。","entryCount":"16个章节","entryCoverRead":"翻开我的故事","entryReadAria":"阅读《我想去看看世界》","entryCoverAlt":"一辆货车驶离宁波的沿海村庄","entryReadAtPace":"用你的语言，慢慢读。","range":"第{start}–{end}页 ↗","bookTitle":"我想去看看世界","chapter.0":"从海边出发","range.0":"第01–03页 ↗","chapter.1":"寻找自己的路","range.1":"第04–08页 ↗","chapter.2":"人生的转折","range.2":"第09–11页 ↗","chapter.3":"更大的世界","range.3":"第12–16页 ↗","page.1.title":"最早的远行","page.1.option":"01 · 最早的远行","page.1.eyebrow":"01 / 从海边出发","page.1.caption.0":"我在宁波咸祥镇的一个沿海村庄长大。","page.1.caption.1":"小时候，我经常住在爸爸的货车上，跟着他一起运货。","page.1.caption.2":"那是我最早看见家乡之外的世界的方式。","page.1.alt.0":"货车行驶在宁波沿海村庄的道路上。","page.1.alt.1":"男孩坐在货车驾驶室里，身旁是开车的父亲。","page.1.alt.2":"男孩望向货车窗外，看着远处的道路。","page.2.title":"家乡之外的世界","page.2.option":"02 · 家乡之外的世界","page.2.eyebrow":"02 / 从海边出发","page.2.caption.0":"每年过年去亲戚家，是我见识城市生活的机会。","page.2.caption.1":"姐姐会带我出去玩，那些是我最温暖的童年记忆之一。","page.2.caption.2":"我逐渐相信，好好读书是我走出去的路。","page.2.caption.3":"考上一所好大学，就能打开更多可能。","page.2.alt.0":"一家人在春节期间去探望亲戚。","page.2.alt.1":"姐姐陪弟弟一起玩耍。","page.2.alt.2":"男孩在家里的书桌前读书。","page.2.alt.3":"男孩从书本中抬起头，望向窗外。","page.3.title":"跑步、跳高与篮球","page.3.option":"03 · 跑步、跳高与篮球","page.3.eyebrow":"03 / 从海边出发","page.3.caption.0":"小学四年级，我代表咸祥镇参加比赛，拿到了鄞州区跳高第一名。","page.3.caption.1":"同一次比赛，我还拿到了800米第四名。","page.3.caption.2":"我一直坚持训练。到了初中，我经常在学校400米和800米比赛中拿第一。","page.3.caption.3":"我从三年级开始打篮球，六年级就能做胯下上篮。","page.3.alt.0":"小学生在跳高比赛中越过横杆。","page.3.alt.1":"男孩参加800米赛跑。","page.3.alt.2":"初中生冲过学校赛跑的终点线。","page.3.alt.3":"男孩在篮球场上完成上篮。","page.4.title":"差一点打开的门","page.4.option":"04 · 差一点打开的门","page.4.eyebrow":"04 / 寻找自己的路","page.4.caption.0":"初一、初二时，我的成绩不太均衡，有些偏科。","page.4.caption.1":"到了初三，我终于追了上来。","page.4.caption.2":"我获得了一所省重点高中的保送考试资格。","page.4.caption.3":"但最后，我没有达到考试的最低分数。","page.4.alt.0":"初中生面对不同学科的课本。","page.4.alt.1":"学生越来越专注地复习。","page.4.alt.2":"学生满怀期待地面对升学机会。","page.4.alt.3":"得知考试结果后，学生安静地失落着。","page.5.title":"重新回到书桌前","page.5.option":"05 · 重新回到书桌前","page.5.eyebrow":"05 / 寻找自己的路","page.5.caption.0":"那次失利对我打击很大，它的阴影在此后很多年都没有散去。","page.5.caption.1":"带着巨大的压力，我重新开始准备中考。","page.5.caption.2":"最终，我考到了班级第一。","page.5.caption.3":"我进入了宁波市正始中学，但与自己原来的期待仍有距离。","page.5.alt.0":"考试失利后，学生独自坐着。","page.5.alt.1":"学生重新投入中考复习。","page.5.alt.2":"学生拿着自己的班级成绩。","page.5.alt.3":"学生走进宁波的一所高中校园。","page.6.title":"在别人的目光里","page.6.option":"06 · 在别人的目光里","page.6.eyebrow":"06 / 寻找自己的路","page.6.caption.0":"进入高中后，随着发育，我的地包天越来越严重。","page.6.caption.1":"我被取了伤人的外号，也遭到过嘲笑。","page.6.caption.2":"我越来越在意别人怎么看我，慢慢失去了自信。","page.6.caption.3":"和别人相处，也渐渐变成一件有压力的事。","page.6.alt.0":"高中生在镜子里看见自己明显的下颌特征。","page.6.alt.1":"学生在学校走廊里感到局促。","page.6.alt.2":"学生与人群保持着距离。","page.6.alt.3":"学生独自走向宿舍。","page.7.title":"夜里的那盏灯","page.7.option":"07 · 夜里的那盏灯","page.7.eyebrow":"07 / 寻找自己的路","page.7.caption.0":"有些夜晚，我躲在宿舍的厕所里哭。","page.7.caption.2":"我很早起床，很晚才睡，把大部分时间都投入了学习。","page.7.caption.3":"高二、高三时，我经常考到年级第一。英语一直是我很自然就能学好的科目。","page.7.alt.0":"安静的宿舍走廊，学生站在厕所门口。","page.7.alt.1":"学生擦去眼泪，术前的下颌特征清晰可见。","page.7.alt.2":"学生在夜里借着温暖的台灯学习。","page.7.alt.3":"学生专注地读着英语课本。","page.8.title":"学习，也开始教书","page.8.option":"08 · 学习，也开始教书","page.8.eyebrow":"08 / 寻找自己的路","page.8.caption.0":"高考的结果，没有达到我的预期。","page.8.caption.1":"我放弃了省外的一所211高校，选择了浙江工商大学。","page.8.caption.2":"高中毕业后，我开始教英语，也一直教到了现在。","page.8.caption.3":"我喜欢语言，也相信自己能学好，所以选择了法语专业。","page.8.caption.4":"大学让我更自由了，但下颌带来的心理困扰仍然没有消失。","page.8.alt.0":"高中毕业生思考自己的高考成绩。","page.8.alt.1":"毕业生权衡大学选择。","page.8.alt.2":"年轻人开始教英语。","page.8.alt.3":"大学生翻开法语课本。","page.8.alt.4":"术前的大学生走在校园里。","page.9.title":"家人在我身边","page.9.option":"09 · 家人在我身边","page.9.eyebrow":"09 / 人生的转折","page.9.caption.0":"家人带我去上海第九人民医院面诊。","page.9.caption.1":"我决定接受正颌手术。","page.9.caption.2":"在手术之前，我需要先做正畸治疗。","page.9.caption.3":"这段过程持续了两年多，比我预想的长得多。","page.9.alt.0":"年轻人与家人在医院候诊。","page.9.alt.1":"一家人听医生介绍治疗方案。","page.9.alt.2":"正颌手术前的一次正畸就诊。","page.9.alt.3":"翻过的日历页暗示着漫长的治疗等待。","page.10.title":"漫长等待之后","page.10.option":"10 · 漫长等待之后","page.10.eyebrow":"10 / 人生的转折","page.10.caption.0":"治疗期间，地包天变得更加明显，心理压力也越来越重。","page.10.caption.1":"我减少了社交，全身心投入学习，专业成绩和综合排名一直保持第一。","page.10.caption.2":"大三下学期，我终于接受了手术。","page.10.alt.0":"大学生在正畸治疗期间独自坐着。","page.10.alt.1":"大学生认真学习，术前的下颌特征清晰可见。","page.10.alt.2":"手术前，年轻人与家人坐在一起。","page.10.alt.3":"手术后，年轻人在医院窗边休息。","page.11.title":"明亮起来的日子","page.11.option":"11 · 明亮起来的日子","page.11.eyebrow":"11 / 人生的转折","page.11.caption.0":"手术改变了我的外貌，我开始重新找回面对日常生活的自信。","page.11.caption.1":"两个月后，我成功保研到西南财经大学国际商学院。","page.11.caption.2":"我也拿到了国家奖学金。经历了那么多压力和等待，那是人生里一个很明亮的时刻。","page.11.alt.0":"术后的大学生走在校园里。","page.11.alt.1":"学生收到研究生推免录取的消息。","page.11.alt.2":"学生拿着文件夹，站在温暖的校园阳光下。","page.12.title":"走进工作的世界","page.12.option":"12 · 走进工作的世界","page.12.eyebrow":"12 / 更大的世界","page.12.caption.0":"保研之后，我去杭州的一家芬兰企业Mingle Advisors实习。","page.12.caption.1":"毕业后，我到宁波凯越集团做法语海外销售，促成了近100万美元的订单。","page.12.caption.2":"然后，我去成都读研究生。","page.12.caption.3":"成都是一段幸福的日子。我一边读书，一边在成都法语联盟实习，也继续教英语。","page.12.alt.0":"在杭州一家公司的办公室里实习。","page.12.alt.1":"在宁波从事海外销售工作。","page.12.alt.2":"抵达成都，开始研究生生活。","page.12.alt.3":"在成都学习并准备语言课程。","page.13.title":"选择出发","page.13.option":"13 · 选择出发","page.13.eyebrow":"13 / 更大的世界","page.13.caption.0":"后来，我又面临一个选择：要不要出国交换？","page.13.caption.1":"如果去，就意味着要延毕。","page.13.caption.2":"我想了很久。从小到大，我都想去看看世界。","page.13.caption.3":"我选择去巴黎第一大学交换一学年。","page.13.alt.0":"阅读海外交换项目的资料。","page.13.alt.1":"在出国交换和延迟毕业之间权衡。","page.13.alt.2":"望向窗外的场景，呼应着童年在货车上的远行。","page.13.alt.3":"准备交换申请材料与行李。","page.14.title":"新的方向","page.14.option":"14 · 新的方向","page.14.eyebrow":"14 / 更大的世界","page.14.caption.0":"出发前，我在成都的字节跳动做了四个月海外人才引进实习。","page.14.caption.1":"我支持字节Seed AI团队在北美招募顶尖人才。","page.14.caption.2":"这段经历带我走进了AI领域，也让我不断深入学习。","page.14.caption.3":"带着正在形成的新方向，我飞往巴黎。","page.14.alt.0":"在成都进行海外人才招聘实习。","page.14.alt.1":"参与一次远程人才沟通。","page.14.alt.2":"通过书本与笔记学习AI。","page.14.alt.3":"在前往巴黎的飞机上望向窗外。","page.15.title":"我世界的边界","page.15.option":"15 · 我世界的边界","page.15.eyebrow":"15 / 更大的世界","page.15.caption.0":"在巴黎的那一年，我还学习了一年的西班牙语。","page.15.caption.1":"我一直热爱语言，也走过巴黎、法国和欧洲的其他地方。","page.15.caption.2":"语言的边界，就是我世界的边界。","page.15.alt.0":"交换生在巴黎的西班牙语课堂上做笔记。","page.15.alt.1":"学生背着包，探索欧洲的街道。","page.15.alt.2":"学生走在阳光下的巴黎街头。","page.15.closing":"那个想去看看世界的小孩，终于走到了这里。","page.16.title":"仍在探索","page.16.option":"16 · 仍在探索","page.16.eyebrow":"16 / 更大的世界","page.16.caption.0":"从巴黎回国后，我来到腾讯云做直客销售实习。","page.16.caption.1":"对AI的了解帮我找到了方向。我继续用AI构建，也不断深入学习云计算。","page.16.caption.2":"从高中毕业起，我就一直在教英语。多年的经验，让我对教学的热情越来越深。","page.16.caption.3":"语言打开了我的世界，而我还有很多地方想去探索。","page.16.alt.0":"开始从事云计算销售工作。","page.16.alt.1":"在电脑上用AI构建与学习。","page.16.alt.2":"充满自信与热情地教英语。","page.16.alt.3":"窗边放着书和电脑，年轻人望向远处。"},"fr":{"eyebrow":"La vie, case par case · Un récit personnel","intro":"D’un village côtier de Ningbo à Paris, à l’enseignement et à la création avec l’IA. Les moments qui m’ont façonné, en seize chapitres illustrés.","description":"Un récit personnel en seize chapitres illustrés : l’enfance sur la côte, la confiance retrouvée, les langues, l’enseignement, Paris et la création avec l’IA.","skip":"Aller à la bande dessinée","navLabel":"Navigation principale","myStory":"← Mon histoire","languagesLabel":"Langue","choosePage":"Choisir une page","previous":"Page précédente","next":"Page suivante","previousLink":"← Page précédente","nextLink":"Page suivante →","chaptersLabel":"Chapitres du récit","continues":"L’histoire continue","backStory":"Retour à mon histoire ↗","textVersion":"Lire la version texte ↗","wordsEyebrow":"L’histoire en mots","wordsTitle":"L’histoire en mots","illustratedVersion":"Lire la version illustrée ↗","backIllustrated":"← Lire la version illustrée","seeFrames":"Voir ce chapitre en images ↗","noScript":"La navigation entre les pages nécessite JavaScript.","noScriptLink":"Lire la version texte complète.","resume":"Reprendre à la page {page} →","pageStatus":"Page {page} sur {total} : {title}.","loadError":"L’illustration n’a pas pu être chargée. Le texte reste disponible sous chaque case.","darkTheme":"Passer au thème sombre","lightTheme":"Passer au thème clair","entryLabel":"La vie en images","entryLead":"Je voulais découvrir","entryAccent":"le monde.","entryIntro":"Un village côtier, le long chemin vers la confiance et les langues qui ont ouvert mon monde. Seize chapitres illustrés, de l’enfance à mes projets d’aujourd’hui.","entryCount":"16 chapitres","entryCoverRead":"Ouvrir mon histoire","entryReadAria":"Lire Je voulais découvrir le monde","entryCoverAlt":"Un camion quitte un village côtier de Ningbo","entryReadAtPace":"Dans votre langue, à votre rythme.","range":"Pages {start}–{end} ↗","bookTitle":"Je voulais découvrir le monde","chapter.0":"Depuis la côte","range.0":"Pages 01–03 ↗","chapter.1":"Trouver ma voie","range.1":"Pages 04–08 ↗","chapter.2":"Un tournant","range.2":"Pages 09–11 ↗","chapter.3":"Un monde plus vaste","range.3":"Pages 12–16 ↗","page.1.title":"Les premiers voyages","page.1.option":"01 · Les premiers voyages","page.1.eyebrow":"01 / Depuis la côte","page.1.caption.0":"J’ai grandi dans un village côtier de Xianxiang, à Ningbo.","page.1.caption.1":"Enfant, je vivais souvent dans le camion de mon père et l’accompagnais pendant ses livraisons.","page.1.caption.2":"C’était ma première fenêtre sur le monde au-delà de chez moi.","page.1.alt.0":"Un camion de marchandises traverse un village côtier de Ningbo.","page.1.alt.1":"Un garçon voyage dans la cabine du camion, à côté de son père.","page.1.alt.2":"Le garçon regarde la route au loin par la fenêtre du camion.","page.2.title":"Au-delà de chez moi","page.2.option":"02 · Au-delà de chez moi","page.2.eyebrow":"02 / Depuis la côte","page.2.caption.0":"Les visites chez des proches pour le Nouvel An chinois me permettaient de découvrir la vie en ville.","page.2.caption.1":"Ma sœur m’emmenait jouer. Ce sont parmi mes souvenirs d’enfance les plus chaleureux.","page.2.caption.2":"J’ai fini par croire que les études étaient ma chance de partir.","page.2.caption.3":"Une bonne université pourrait m’ouvrir davantage de possibilités.","page.2.alt.0":"Une famille rend visite à des proches pour le Nouvel An chinois.","page.2.alt.1":"Une grande sœur joue avec son petit frère.","page.2.alt.2":"Le garçon étudie à son bureau, chez lui.","page.2.alt.3":"Le garçon lève les yeux de son livre vers la fenêtre.","page.3.title":"Courir, sauter, jouer","page.3.option":"03 · Courir, sauter, jouer","page.3.eyebrow":"03 / Depuis la côte","page.3.caption.0":"En quatrième année de primaire, j’ai représenté Xianxiang et remporté le concours de saut en hauteur du district de Yinzhou.","page.3.caption.1":"J’ai aussi terminé quatrième du 800 mètres.","page.3.caption.2":"J’ai continué à m’entraîner. Au collège, je remportais souvent les courses de 400 et 800 mètres de l’établissement.","page.3.caption.3":"J’ai commencé le basket en troisième année de primaire. En sixième année, je savais déjà faire un lay-up en passant le ballon entre mes jambes.","page.3.alt.0":"Un écolier franchit la barre lors d’un concours de saut en hauteur.","page.3.alt.1":"Le garçon court un 800 mètres.","page.3.alt.2":"Un collégien franchit la ligne d’arrivée.","page.3.alt.3":"Un garçon réalise un lay-up sur un terrain de basket.","page.4.title":"La porte presque ouverte","page.4.option":"04 · La porte presque ouverte","page.4.eyebrow":"04 / Trouver ma voie","page.4.caption.0":"Mes résultats étaient inégaux pendant mes deux premières années de collège.","page.4.caption.1":"En dernière année, j’ai rattrapé mon retard.","page.4.caption.2":"J’ai obtenu le droit de passer un examen d’admission spécial dans un lycée d’excellence de la province.","page.4.caption.3":"Mais je n’ai pas atteint la note minimale.","page.4.alt.0":"Un collégien face aux manuels de plusieurs matières.","page.4.alt.1":"L’élève révise avec une concentration croissante.","page.4.alt.2":"L’élève envisage une possibilité d’admission avec espoir.","page.4.alt.3":"L’élève reçoit ses résultats avec une déception silencieuse.","page.5.title":"Retour au bureau","page.5.option":"05 · Retour au bureau","page.5.eyebrow":"05 / Trouver ma voie","page.5.caption.0":"Cet échec m’a profondément marqué. Son ombre m’a accompagné pendant des années.","page.5.caption.1":"Sous une immense pression, j’ai repris la préparation de l’examen ordinaire d’entrée au lycée.","page.5.caption.2":"J’ai finalement terminé premier de ma classe.","page.5.caption.3":"Je suis entré au lycée Zhengshi, à Ningbo, encore loin de ce que j’avais espéré.","page.5.alt.0":"Un élève assis seul après un examen décevant.","page.5.alt.1":"L’élève reprend ses révisions pour l’entrée au lycée.","page.5.alt.2":"L’élève tient ses résultats de classe.","page.5.alt.3":"L’élève entre dans un lycée de Ningbo.","page.6.title":"Sous le regard des autres","page.6.option":"06 · Sous le regard des autres","page.6.eyebrow":"06 / Trouver ma voie","page.6.caption.0":"En grandissant au lycée, ma mâchoire inférieure s’est avancée de façon très marquée.","page.6.caption.1":"On m’a donné des surnoms blessants et on s’est moqué de moi.","page.6.caption.2":"Le regard des autres est devenu douloureusement présent. Ma confiance s’est effacée.","page.6.caption.3":"Être avec les autres est peu à peu devenu une source de stress.","page.6.alt.0":"Un lycéen observe sa mâchoire inférieure avancée dans le miroir.","page.6.alt.1":"L’élève se sent mal à l’aise dans un couloir du lycée.","page.6.alt.2":"L’élève reste à l’écart d’un groupe.","page.6.alt.3":"L’élève marche seul vers son dortoir.","page.7.title":"Une lumière dans la nuit","page.7.option":"07 · Une lumière dans la nuit","page.7.eyebrow":"07 / Trouver ma voie","page.7.caption.0":"Certaines nuits, je me cachais dans les toilettes du dortoir pour pleurer.","page.7.caption.2":"Je me levais tôt, me couchais tard et consacrais une grande partie de mon temps aux études.","page.7.caption.3":"Pendant mes deux dernières années de lycée, j’étais souvent premier de ma promotion. L’anglais m’avait toujours semblé naturel.","page.7.alt.0":"Un couloir de dortoir silencieux et un élève à la porte des toilettes.","page.7.alt.1":"L’élève essuie ses larmes ; sa mâchoire avant l’opération reste bien visible.","page.7.alt.2":"L’élève étudie la nuit sous une lampe de bureau chaleureuse.","page.7.alt.3":"L’élève se concentre sur un manuel d’anglais.","page.8.title":"Apprendre et enseigner","page.8.option":"08 · Apprendre et enseigner","page.8.eyebrow":"08 / Trouver ma voie","page.8.caption.0":"Mon examen d’entrée à l’université ne s’est pas aussi bien passé que je l’espérais.","page.8.caption.1":"J’ai choisi l’Université Zhejiang Gongshang plutôt qu’une université du programme 211 située hors du Zhejiang.","page.8.caption.2":"Après le lycée, j’ai commencé à enseigner l’anglais. Je n’ai jamais cessé depuis.","page.8.caption.3":"J’aimais les langues et je croyais en ma capacité à les apprendre ; j’ai donc choisi le français comme spécialité.","page.8.caption.4":"L’université m’a donné plus de liberté, mais la souffrance liée à ma mâchoire persistait.","page.8.alt.0":"Un bachelier réfléchit à ses résultats d’entrée à l’université.","page.8.alt.1":"Le jeune diplômé compare ses choix universitaires.","page.8.alt.2":"Le jeune homme commence à enseigner l’anglais.","page.8.alt.3":"Un étudiant ouvre un manuel de français.","page.8.alt.4":"L’étudiant traverse le campus avant son opération de la mâchoire.","page.9.title":"Ma famille à mes côtés","page.9.option":"09 · Ma famille à mes côtés","page.9.eyebrow":"09 / Un tournant","page.9.caption.0":"Ma famille m’a accompagné au Neuvième Hôpital du Peuple de Shanghai pour une consultation.","page.9.caption.1":"J’ai décidé de subir une chirurgie corrective des mâchoires.","page.9.caption.2":"Avant l’opération, je devais suivre un traitement orthodontique.","page.9.caption.3":"Il a duré plus de deux ans, bien plus longtemps que prévu.","page.9.alt.0":"Un jeune homme et sa famille dans une salle d’attente de l’hôpital.","page.9.alt.1":"La famille écoute le médecin pendant une consultation.","page.9.alt.2":"Un rendez-vous d’orthodontie avant la chirurgie des mâchoires.","page.9.alt.3":"Des pages de calendrier évoquent la longue attente du traitement.","page.10.title":"Après la longue attente","page.10.option":"10 · Après la longue attente","page.10.eyebrow":"10 / Un tournant","page.10.caption.0":"Pendant le traitement, le décalage de ma mâchoire s’est accentué et la souffrance psychologique a grandi.","page.10.caption.1":"Je me suis retiré de la vie sociale pour me concentrer sur les études. Je suis resté premier de ma spécialité, tant pour les résultats que pour le classement global.","page.10.caption.2":"Au second semestre de ma troisième année, j’ai enfin été opéré.","page.10.alt.0":"Un étudiant assis seul pendant son traitement orthodontique.","page.10.alt.1":"L’étudiant travaille ; sa mâchoire avant l’opération est bien visible.","page.10.alt.2":"Le jeune homme avec un membre de sa famille avant l’opération.","page.10.alt.3":"Le jeune homme se repose près d’une fenêtre à l’hôpital après l’opération.","page.11.title":"Un chapitre plus lumineux","page.11.option":"11 · Un chapitre plus lumineux","page.11.eyebrow":"11 / Un tournant","page.11.caption.0":"L’opération a changé mon apparence. J’ai commencé à retrouver la confiance nécessaire pour vivre mon quotidien.","page.11.caption.1":"Deux mois plus tard, j’ai été admis sur recommandation en master à l’École de commerce international de l’Université de finance et d’économie du Sud-Ouest.","page.11.caption.2":"J’ai aussi reçu la bourse nationale. Après tant de pression et d’attente, ce fut un moment lumineux de ma vie.","page.11.alt.0":"Un étudiant marche sur le campus après son opération de la mâchoire.","page.11.alt.1":"L’étudiant apprend son admission en master.","page.11.alt.2":"L’étudiant tient un dossier dans la lumière chaleureuse du campus.","page.12.title":"Entrer dans le monde du travail","page.12.option":"12 · Entrer dans le monde du travail","page.12.eyebrow":"12 / Un monde plus vaste","page.12.caption.0":"Après avoir obtenu ma place en master, j’ai fait un stage chez Mingle Advisors, une entreprise finlandaise à Hangzhou.","page.12.caption.1":"Après mon diplôme, j’ai travaillé dans la vente à l’export vers les marchés francophones chez Market Union, à Ningbo, et contribué à conclure près d’un million de dollars de commandes.","page.12.caption.2":"Puis je suis parti à Chengdu pour mon master.","page.12.caption.3":"Chengdu a été un chapitre heureux. J’y étudiais, faisais un stage à l’Alliance Française et continuais à enseigner l’anglais.","page.12.alt.0":"Un stage dans les bureaux d’une entreprise à Hangzhou.","page.12.alt.1":"Un travail de vente à l’export à Ningbo.","page.12.alt.2":"L’arrivée à Chengdu pour des études de master.","page.12.alt.3":"Étudier et préparer des cours de langues à Chengdu.","page.13.title":"Choisir de partir","page.13.option":"13 · Choisir de partir","page.13.eyebrow":"13 / Un monde plus vaste","page.13.caption.0":"Une autre décision s’est alors présentée : devais-je partir en échange à l’étranger ?","page.13.caption.1":"Partir signifiait retarder l’obtention de mon diplôme.","page.13.caption.2":"J’y ai longtemps réfléchi. Depuis l’enfance, je voulais découvrir le monde.","page.13.caption.3":"J’ai choisi un échange d’une année à l’Université Paris 1 Panthéon-Sorbonne.","page.13.alt.0":"Lecture des informations sur un programme d’échange à l’étranger.","page.13.alt.1":"Réflexion entre un échange et une fin d’études plus tardive.","page.13.alt.2":"Une scène à la fenêtre fait écho aux voyages en camion de l’enfance.","page.13.alt.3":"Préparation du dossier d’échange et des bagages.","page.14.title":"Une nouvelle direction","page.14.option":"14 · Une nouvelle direction","page.14.eyebrow":"14 / Un monde plus vaste","page.14.caption.0":"Avant de partir, j’ai effectué quatre mois de stage en recrutement international chez ByteDance, à Chengdu.","page.14.caption.1":"J’ai aidé l’équipe Seed AI de ByteDance à recruter des talents de premier plan en Amérique du Nord.","page.14.caption.2":"Cette expérience m’a fait entrer dans l’univers de l’IA et m’a poussé à approfondir mes connaissances.","page.14.caption.3":"Avec cette nouvelle direction qui se dessinait, je suis parti pour Paris.","page.14.alt.0":"Un stage en recrutement international à Chengdu.","page.14.alt.1":"Participation à un échange à distance avec des talents.","page.14.alt.2":"Découverte de l’IA à travers des livres et des notes.","page.14.alt.3":"Regard par le hublot d’un avion en route pour Paris.","page.15.title":"Les limites de mon monde","page.15.option":"15 · Les limites de mon monde","page.15.eyebrow":"15 / Un monde plus vaste","page.15.caption.0":"Pendant mon année à Paris, j’ai aussi appris l’espagnol pendant un an.","page.15.caption.1":"J’ai toujours aimé les langues. J’ai exploré Paris, la France et d’autres régions d’Europe.","page.15.caption.2":"Les limites de ma langue sont les limites de mon monde.","page.15.alt.0":"Un étudiant en échange prend des notes dans un cours d’espagnol à Paris.","page.15.alt.1":"L’étudiant explore une rue européenne avec son sac.","page.15.alt.2":"L’étudiant marche dans une rue parisienne ensoleillée.","page.15.closing":"L’enfant qui voulait découvrir le monde y était enfin arrivé.","page.16.title":"Toujours en exploration","page.16.option":"16 · Toujours en exploration","page.16.eyebrow":"16 / Un monde plus vaste","page.16.caption.0":"À mon retour de Paris, j’ai rejoint Tencent Cloud comme stagiaire commercial auprès des clients directs.","page.16.caption.1":"Mon expérience de l’IA m’a aidé à trouver ma direction. Je continue à créer avec l’IA et à approfondir le cloud computing.","page.16.caption.2":"J’enseigne l’anglais depuis la fin du lycée. Ces années d’expérience n’ont fait que renforcer ma passion pour l’enseignement.","page.16.caption.3":"Les langues ont ouvert mon monde. Et il me reste tant de choses à explorer.","page.16.alt.0":"Les débuts dans la vente de solutions cloud.","page.16.alt.1":"Créer et apprendre avec l’IA sur un ordinateur portable.","page.16.alt.2":"Enseigner l’anglais avec confiance et enthousiasme.","page.16.alt.3":"Regarder par la fenêtre, avec des livres et un ordinateur à proximité."},"es":{"eyebrow":"La vida, viñeta a viñeta · Un relato personal","intro":"De un pueblo costero de Ningbo a París, a la enseñanza y a crear con IA. Los momentos que me marcaron, en dieciséis capítulos ilustrados.","description":"Una historia personal en dieciséis capítulos ilustrados: crecer en la costa, recuperar la confianza, aprender idiomas, enseñar, París y crear con IA.","skip":"Ir al cómic","navLabel":"Navegación principal","myStory":"← Mi historia","languagesLabel":"Idioma","choosePage":"Elegir una página","previous":"Página anterior","next":"Página siguiente","previousLink":"← Página anterior","nextLink":"Página siguiente →","chaptersLabel":"Capítulos de la historia","continues":"La historia continúa","backStory":"Volver a mi historia ↗","textVersion":"Leer la versión de texto ↗","wordsEyebrow":"La historia en palabras","wordsTitle":"La historia en palabras","illustratedVersion":"Leer la versión ilustrada ↗","backIllustrated":"← Leer la versión ilustrada","seeFrames":"Ver este capítulo en viñetas ↗","noScript":"La navegación entre páginas requiere JavaScript.","noScriptLink":"Leer la versión de texto completa.","resume":"Continuar desde la página {page} →","pageStatus":"Página {page} de {total}: {title}.","loadError":"No se pudo cargar la ilustración. El texto sigue disponible debajo de cada viñeta.","darkTheme":"Cambiar al tema oscuro","lightTheme":"Cambiar al tema claro","entryLabel":"La vida en viñetas","entryLead":"Quería conocer","entryAccent":"el mundo.","entryIntro":"Un pueblo costero, el largo camino hacia la confianza y los idiomas que abrieron mi mundo. Dieciséis capítulos ilustrados, desde la infancia hasta lo que construyo hoy.","entryCount":"16 capítulos","entryCoverRead":"Abrir mi historia","entryReadAria":"Leer Quería conocer el mundo","entryCoverAlt":"Un camión sale de un pueblo costero de Ningbo","entryReadAtPace":"En tu idioma, a tu ritmo.","range":"Páginas {start}–{end} ↗","bookTitle":"Quería conocer el mundo","chapter.0":"Desde la costa","range.0":"Páginas 01–03 ↗","chapter.1":"Encontrar mi camino","range.1":"Páginas 04–08 ↗","chapter.2":"Un punto de inflexión","range.2":"Páginas 09–11 ↗","chapter.3":"Un mundo más amplio","range.3":"Páginas 12–16 ↗","page.1.title":"Los primeros viajes","page.1.option":"01 · Los primeros viajes","page.1.eyebrow":"01 / Desde la costa","page.1.caption.0":"Crecí en un pueblo costero de Xianxiang, en Ningbo.","page.1.caption.1":"De niño, a menudo vivía en el camión de mi padre y lo acompañaba en sus entregas.","page.1.caption.2":"Aquella fue mi primera ventana al mundo más allá de casa.","page.1.alt.0":"Un camión de mercancías recorre un pueblo costero de Ningbo.","page.1.alt.1":"Un niño viaja en la cabina del camión junto a su padre.","page.1.alt.2":"El niño mira la carretera a lo lejos por la ventanilla del camión.","page.2.title":"Más allá de casa","page.2.option":"02 · Más allá de casa","page.2.eyebrow":"02 / Desde la costa","page.2.caption.0":"Las visitas a familiares durante el Año Nuevo chino eran mi oportunidad de conocer la vida en la ciudad.","page.2.caption.1":"Mi hermana me llevaba a jugar. Son algunos de mis recuerdos más cálidos de la infancia.","page.2.caption.2":"Llegué a creer que estudiar era mi camino para salir de allí.","page.2.caption.3":"Una buena universidad podía abrirme más posibilidades.","page.2.alt.0":"Una familia visita a sus parientes durante el Año Nuevo chino.","page.2.alt.1":"Una hermana mayor juega con su hermano pequeño.","page.2.alt.2":"El niño estudia en su escritorio en casa.","page.2.alt.3":"El niño levanta la mirada de un libro hacia la ventana.","page.3.title":"Correr, saltar y jugar","page.3.option":"03 · Correr, saltar y jugar","page.3.eyebrow":"03 / Desde la costa","page.3.caption.0":"En cuarto de primaria, representé a Xianxiang y gané la competición de salto de altura del distrito de Yinzhou.","page.3.caption.1":"También quedé cuarto en los 800 metros.","page.3.caption.2":"Seguí entrenando. En la secundaria, ganaba a menudo las carreras de 400 y 800 metros de mi centro.","page.3.caption.3":"Empecé a jugar al baloncesto en tercero de primaria. En sexto ya podía hacer una entrada pasando el balón entre las piernas.","page.3.alt.0":"Un escolar supera el listón en una competición de salto de altura.","page.3.alt.1":"El niño corre una carrera de 800 metros.","page.3.alt.2":"Un estudiante cruza la meta en una carrera escolar.","page.3.alt.3":"Un niño realiza una entrada a canasta.","page.4.title":"La puerta que casi alcancé","page.4.option":"04 · La puerta que casi alcancé","page.4.eyebrow":"04 / Encontrar mi camino","page.4.caption.0":"Mis notas eran desiguales durante los dos primeros años de secundaria.","page.4.caption.1":"En el último año, logré ponerme al día.","page.4.caption.2":"Conseguí una plaza para presentarme al examen especial de admisión de un destacado instituto de la provincia.","page.4.caption.3":"Pero no alcancé la nota mínima.","page.4.alt.0":"Un estudiante ante libros de varias asignaturas.","page.4.alt.1":"El estudiante repasa con una concentración cada vez mayor.","page.4.alt.2":"El estudiante contempla una oportunidad de admisión con ilusión.","page.4.alt.3":"El estudiante recibe los resultados con una decepción silenciosa.","page.5.title":"Volver al escritorio","page.5.option":"05 · Volver al escritorio","page.5.eyebrow":"05 / Encontrar mi camino","page.5.caption.0":"Aquel revés me golpeó con fuerza. Su sombra me acompañó durante años.","page.5.caption.1":"Bajo una enorme presión, volví a preparar el examen ordinario de acceso al bachillerato.","page.5.caption.2":"Al final, terminé primero de mi clase.","page.5.caption.3":"Entré en el Instituto Zhengshi de Ningbo, todavía lejos de lo que había esperado.","page.5.alt.0":"Un estudiante se sienta solo tras un examen decepcionante.","page.5.alt.1":"El estudiante vuelve a preparar el examen de acceso.","page.5.alt.2":"El estudiante sostiene sus resultados de clase.","page.5.alt.3":"El estudiante entra en un instituto de Ningbo.","page.6.title":"Bajo la mirada de los demás","page.6.option":"06 · Bajo la mirada de los demás","page.6.eyebrow":"06 / Encontrar mi camino","page.6.caption.0":"Durante el bachillerato, mi mandíbula inferior empezó a sobresalir de forma muy marcada.","page.6.caption.1":"Me pusieron apodos hirientes y se burlaron de mí.","page.6.caption.2":"Cada vez me afectaba más cómo me veían los demás. Mi confianza se fue apagando.","page.6.caption.3":"Estar con otras personas se convirtió poco a poco en una fuente de estrés.","page.6.alt.0":"Un estudiante observa en el espejo su mandíbula inferior adelantada.","page.6.alt.1":"El estudiante se siente incómodo en un pasillo del instituto.","page.6.alt.2":"El estudiante permanece apartado de un grupo.","page.6.alt.3":"El estudiante camina solo hacia su residencia.","page.7.title":"Una luz en la noche","page.7.option":"07 · Una luz en la noche","page.7.eyebrow":"07 / Encontrar mi camino","page.7.caption.0":"Algunas noches me escondía en el baño de la residencia para llorar.","page.7.caption.2":"Me levantaba temprano, me acostaba tarde y dedicaba gran parte de mi tiempo a estudiar.","page.7.caption.3":"En mis dos últimos años de bachillerato, a menudo quedaba primero de mi curso. El inglés siempre se me había dado de forma natural.","page.7.alt.0":"Un pasillo silencioso de la residencia y un estudiante en la puerta del baño.","page.7.alt.1":"El estudiante se seca las lágrimas; se aprecia la mandíbula antes de la operación.","page.7.alt.2":"El estudiante estudia de noche bajo una cálida lámpara de escritorio.","page.7.alt.3":"El estudiante se concentra en un libro de inglés.","page.8.title":"Aprender y enseñar","page.8.option":"08 · Aprender y enseñar","page.8.eyebrow":"08 / Encontrar mi camino","page.8.caption.0":"Mi examen de acceso a la universidad no salió tan bien como esperaba.","page.8.caption.1":"Elegí la Universidad Zhejiang Gongshang en lugar de una universidad del programa 211 fuera de Zhejiang.","page.8.caption.2":"Al terminar el bachillerato, empecé a enseñar inglés. Desde entonces, nunca he dejado de hacerlo.","page.8.caption.3":"Me encantaban los idiomas y confiaba en mi capacidad para aprenderlos, así que elegí especializarme en francés.","page.8.caption.4":"La universidad me dio más libertad, pero el malestar por mi mandíbula seguía ahí.","page.8.alt.0":"Un recién graduado de bachillerato reflexiona sobre sus resultados de acceso.","page.8.alt.1":"El joven compara sus opciones universitarias.","page.8.alt.2":"El joven empieza a enseñar inglés.","page.8.alt.3":"Un universitario abre un manual de francés.","page.8.alt.4":"El universitario camina por el campus antes de la operación de mandíbula.","page.9.title":"Mi familia a mi lado","page.9.option":"09 · Mi familia a mi lado","page.9.eyebrow":"09 / Un punto de inflexión","page.9.caption.0":"Mi familia me acompañó al Noveno Hospital del Pueblo de Shanghái para una consulta.","page.9.caption.1":"Decidí someterme a una cirugía correctiva de los maxilares.","page.9.caption.2":"Antes de la operación, necesitaba un tratamiento de ortodoncia.","page.9.caption.3":"Duró más de dos años, mucho más de lo que había previsto.","page.9.alt.0":"Un joven y su familia en una sala de espera del hospital.","page.9.alt.1":"La familia escucha al médico durante una consulta.","page.9.alt.2":"Una cita de ortodoncia antes de la cirugía de los maxilares.","page.9.alt.3":"Las hojas del calendario evocan la larga espera del tratamiento.","page.10.title":"Después de la larga espera","page.10.option":"10 · Después de la larga espera","page.10.eyebrow":"10 / Un punto de inflexión","page.10.caption.0":"Durante el tratamiento, mi mandíbula sobresalía aún más y la carga emocional fue creciendo.","page.10.caption.1":"Reduje mi vida social y me concentré en estudiar. Me mantuve primero de mi especialidad, tanto en notas como en la clasificación general.","page.10.caption.2":"En el segundo semestre de mi tercer año, por fin me operaron.","page.10.alt.0":"Un universitario se sienta solo durante el tratamiento de ortodoncia.","page.10.alt.1":"El universitario estudia; se aprecia claramente su mandíbula antes de la operación.","page.10.alt.2":"El joven con un familiar antes de la cirugía.","page.10.alt.3":"El joven descansa junto a una ventana del hospital después de la operación.","page.11.title":"Un capítulo más luminoso","page.11.option":"11 · Un capítulo más luminoso","page.11.eyebrow":"11 / Un punto de inflexión","page.11.caption.0":"La operación cambió mi aspecto. Empecé a recuperar la confianza para afrontar la vida cotidiana.","page.11.caption.1":"Dos meses después, conseguí la admisión por recomendación a un máster en la Escuela de Negocios Internacionales de la Universidad de Finanzas y Economía del Suroeste.","page.11.caption.2":"También recibí la Beca Nacional. Después de tanta presión y espera, fue un momento luminoso en mi vida.","page.11.alt.0":"Un universitario camina por el campus tras la operación de mandíbula.","page.11.alt.1":"El estudiante recibe la noticia de su admisión al máster.","page.11.alt.2":"El estudiante sostiene una carpeta bajo la cálida luz del campus.","page.12.title":"Entrar en el mundo laboral","page.12.option":"12 · Entrar en el mundo laboral","page.12.eyebrow":"12 / Un mundo más amplio","page.12.caption.0":"Tras asegurar mi plaza de máster, hice prácticas en Mingle Advisors, una empresa finlandesa de Hangzhou.","page.12.caption.1":"Después de graduarme, trabajé en ventas internacionales para mercados francófonos en Market Union, en Ningbo, y ayudé a cerrar pedidos por casi un millón de dólares.","page.12.caption.2":"Luego me trasladé a Chengdu para estudiar el máster.","page.12.caption.3":"Chengdu fue un capítulo feliz. Estudiaba, hacía prácticas en la Alliance Française y seguía enseñando inglés.","page.12.alt.0":"Unas prácticas en las oficinas de una empresa de Hangzhou.","page.12.alt.1":"Un trabajo de ventas internacionales en Ningbo.","page.12.alt.2":"La llegada a Chengdu para estudiar un máster.","page.12.alt.3":"Estudiar y preparar clases de idiomas en Chengdu.","page.13.title":"Elegir partir","page.13.option":"13 · Elegir partir","page.13.eyebrow":"13 / Un mundo más amplio","page.13.caption.0":"Entonces llegó otra decisión: ¿debía irme de intercambio al extranjero?","page.13.caption.1":"Irme significaba retrasar la graduación.","page.13.caption.2":"Lo pensé durante mucho tiempo. Desde niño había querido conocer el mundo.","page.13.caption.3":"Elegí un intercambio de un año en la Universidad París 1 Panthéon-Sorbonne.","page.13.alt.0":"Lectura de información sobre un programa de intercambio en el extranjero.","page.13.alt.1":"Reflexión entre el intercambio y una graduación más tardía.","page.13.alt.2":"Una escena junto a la ventana recuerda los viajes en camión de la infancia.","page.13.alt.3":"Preparación de los documentos del intercambio y del equipaje.","page.14.title":"Una nueva dirección","page.14.option":"14 · Una nueva dirección","page.14.eyebrow":"14 / Un mundo más amplio","page.14.caption.0":"Antes de partir, hice cuatro meses de prácticas en captación internacional de talento en ByteDance, en Chengdu.","page.14.caption.1":"Ayudé al equipo Seed AI de ByteDance a contratar talento de primer nivel en Norteamérica.","page.14.caption.2":"Aquella experiencia me acercó a la IA y me impulsó a seguir aprendiendo.","page.14.caption.3":"Con una nueva dirección que empezaba a tomar forma, salí hacia París.","page.14.alt.0":"Unas prácticas de captación internacional de talento en Chengdu.","page.14.alt.1":"Participación en una conversación remota con profesionales.","page.14.alt.2":"Aprender sobre IA mediante libros y apuntes.","page.14.alt.3":"Mirar por la ventanilla de un avión de camino a París.","page.15.title":"Los límites de mi mundo","page.15.option":"15 · Los límites de mi mundo","page.15.eyebrow":"15 / Un mundo más amplio","page.15.caption.0":"Durante mi año en París, también dediqué un año a aprender español.","page.15.caption.1":"Siempre me han apasionado los idiomas. Recorrí París, Francia y otras partes de Europa.","page.15.caption.2":"Los límites de mi lenguaje son los límites de mi mundo.","page.15.alt.0":"Un estudiante de intercambio toma apuntes en una clase de español en París.","page.15.alt.1":"El estudiante explora una calle europea con su mochila.","page.15.alt.2":"El estudiante camina por una calle soleada de París.","page.15.closing":"El niño que quería conocer el mundo por fin había llegado hasta allí.","page.16.title":"Sigo explorando","page.16.option":"16 · Sigo explorando","page.16.eyebrow":"16 / Un mundo más amplio","page.16.caption.0":"Al regresar de París, me incorporé a Tencent Cloud como becario de ventas a clientes directos.","page.16.caption.1":"Mi experiencia con la IA me ayudó a encontrar mi rumbo. Sigo creando con IA y profundizando en la computación en la nube.","page.16.caption.2":"Enseño inglés desde que terminé el bachillerato. Los años de experiencia solo han reforzado mi entusiasmo por enseñar.","page.16.caption.3":"Los idiomas me abrieron el mundo. Y aún me queda mucho por explorar.","page.16.alt.0":"Los comienzos en la venta de soluciones en la nube.","page.16.alt.1":"Crear y aprender con IA en un ordenador portátil.","page.16.alt.2":"Enseñar inglés con confianza y entusiasmo.","page.16.alt.3":"Mirar por la ventana, con libros y un ordenador cerca."}};
